(7539373, 1206466, 62357, '<td valign="top">Paul, I think it depends which browser is used. I''m on my phone right now and it looks fine, but during voting on my desktop it came up and was displaying upside down as though it was flipped. I''ve seen a few photos like this recently. Seems to happen if you upload direct from the iPhone. I''ll add a screenshot from my desktop so you can see what it looked like. I think that will help you understand a) the score b) the comments.  It did look like it was entered into the wrong challenge.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1206864" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62357/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1206864.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62357/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1206864.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62357/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1206864.png"/></a> <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-10-16 13:29:07.</i></td>', 'Paul, I think it depends which browser is used. I''m on my phone right now and it looks fine, but during voting on my desktop it came up and was displaying upside down as though it was flipped. I''ve seen a few photos like this recently. Seems to happen if you upload direct from the iPhone. I''ll add a screenshot from my desktop so you can see what it looked like. I think that will help you understand a) the score b) the comments.  It did look like it was entered into the wrong challenge.  ', '2017-10-16 14:25:00.000000', '2017-10-16 14:29:07.000000', 0),
(7539375, 1206466, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by salmiakki:</b></div><hr/><i> Paul, I think it depends which browser is used. I''m on my phone right now, but during voting on my desktop it came up and was displaying upside down as though it was flipped. I''ve seen a few things like this. Seems to happen if you upload direct from the iPhone. I''ll add a screenshot from my desktop so you can see what it looked like. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks so much!<br/> <br/>I did upload straight from the phone and have never bothered to look at it on my computer. It''s upside down for me too on my laptop.<br/> <br/>Oh well, the image was a bit crap anyway ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by salmiakki: Paul, I think it depends which browser is used. I''m on my phone right now, but during voting on my desktop it came up and was displaying upside down as though it was flipped. I''ve seen a few things like this. Seems to happen if you upload direct from the iPhone. I''ll add a screenshot from my desktop so you can see what it looked like.   Thanks so much! I did upload straight from the phone and have never bothered to look at it on my computer. It''s upside down for me too on my laptop. Oh well, the image was a bit crap anyway ;-)', '2017-10-16 14:28:23.000000', NULL, 0),
